Source: pbs-client-rust
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ciro Iriarte <ciro.iriarte+software@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13~), xz-utils
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://www.rust-lang.org

Package: pbs-client-rust
Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf ppc64el s390x
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Private prebuilt Rust toolchain for building proxmox-backup-client
 Prebuilt upstream Rust toolchain (rustc, cargo, rust-std) under
 /opt/pbs-client-rust, used exclusively as a build dependency of
 proxmox-backup-client so its build is independent of the distribution's Rust
 version. Community/unofficial; not intended for end users.
